Icons for znapzend-full
=======================

These icons were created specifically for the znapzend-full project.

License: CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication)
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

You can copy, modify, distribute and perform the work, even for commercial
purposes, all without asking permission.

Icon descriptions:
- idle.svg: Shield with checkmark (backup complete/protected)
- backing_up.svg: Sync arrows (data transfer in progress)
- paused.svg: Pause symbol (backups paused)
- error.svg: Warning triangle with exclamation (error state)
- unknown.svg: Question mark (connection unknown)
